### Add buddy 1 to address book 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/addressbooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/api/buddies/1

### Add buddy 2 to address book 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/addressbooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/api/buddies/2

### 4. Check the JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/addressbooks/1/buddies
Accept: application/json

